1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,080
And so I answered the phone, and the boss told me,

2
00:00:04,280 --> 00:00:11,280
Hey, Luca, I want you to know that we want you to be the pilot on the Artemis III mission.

3
00:00:12,340 --> 00:00:15,280
And I was very much unprepared for that answer.

4
00:00:15,940 --> 00:00:20,580
And so it went through one ear, it didn't register in my brain, came out the other ear.

5
00:00:20,920 --> 00:00:23,720
And I literally said, Can you say that again?

6
00:00:24,500 --> 00:00:25,960
And it told me the same words.

7
00:00:26,990 --> 00:00:30,750
And then it did register, but I was in a public environment,

8
00:00:30,750 --> 00:00:34,740
so I knew that I couldn't say anything out loud.

9
00:00:35,020 --> 00:00:37,960
So I was literally speechless, which doesn't happen very often.

10
00:00:38,620 --> 00:00:45,700
And then I was very, very honored when I, when I met the crew for the first time a couple of days later.

